                "claim": "The error message now interpolates h.PayloadKind. For a record where PayloadKind is empty or unexpected, the message would read 'the evidence of the  could not be checked'. Only completed review-report and review-exemption records reach this path in practice, so impact is low, and the tests assert the review-exemption wording but not a review-report regression.",
