            ],
            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all four changed paths. The core evidence-check logic (review/app CheckEvidence) is not part of this candidate; only the message wiring, usage text and tests changed.",
              "The new tests cover the happy path, missing and mismatched digests, edited exemption content, a failing report, no repository, and an interrupted exemption stored without a repository lookup, all via externally observable exit code, stdout and stderr and chain state.",
              "The usage test checks that engine and wrapper wording agree.",
              "The error format for review-report is unchanged when PayloadKind is review-report, so there is no baseline regression. Whether PayloadKind holds that exact string is not visible in this patch, so I flag it only as a low-severity warning."
